      "id": "sce-ent-types-of-entrepreneurship-c2",
      "heading": "Commercial vs social entrepreneurship",
      "explanation_md": "Entrepreneurship splits into **commercial entrepreneurship** and **social entrepreneurship**.\n\nIn **commercial entrepreneurship**:\n\n- the main aim is **economic value creation**: **profit and wealth creation**, which can come with **negative externalities**;\n- **social value is a byproduct**: **CSR, employment and taxes**.\n\nSo a commercial venture creates social value along the way, but it is not the goal.",
